<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>RARPA Evidence Report — {{org.name}}</title>
    <style>
      /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         Global page setup — see docs/EVIDENCE_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md §1
         A4 with 20mm margins, watermark, page-number footer.
         ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      @page { size: A4; margin: 20mm; }

      html, body {
        font-family: "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 10.5pt;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: #0b2343;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      /* Diagonal watermark on every page */
      body::before {
        content: "AMBER TRAINING — EVIDENCE";
        position: fixed;
        top: 45%;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 64pt;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.3em;
        color: rgba(11, 35, 67, 0.04);
        transform: rotate(-30deg);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      /* Section primitives */
      .section { page-break-before: always; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
      .section:first-of-type { page-break-before: auto; }

      h1.section-title {
        font-size: 18pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 4mm 0;
        padding-bottom: 2mm;
        border-bottom: 2pt solid #facc15; /* Amber yellow */
        color: #0b2343;
      }
      h2 { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 600; margin: 6mm 0 2mm 0; }
      h3 { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 600; margin: 4mm 0 1mm 0; }

      p { margin: 0 0 2mm 0; }
      .muted { color: #5a6b85; font-size: 9.5pt; }
      .dash { color: #94a3b8; }

      table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 9.5pt;
        margin: 2mm 0 4mm 0;
      }
      th, td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 2mm 3mm;
        border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #d6deea;
        vertical-align: top;
      }
      th { background: #f4f6fb; font-weight: 600; color: #0b2343; }
      tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fbfcfe; }

      .kv { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4mm 8mm; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
      .kv > div { min-width: 40mm; }
      .kv .k { color: #5a6b85; font-size: 9pt; }
      .kv .v { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 600; color: #0b2343; }

      .callout {
        border-left: 3pt solid #facc15;
        background: #fffbeb;
        padding: 3mm 4mm;
        margin: 3mm 0;
        font-size: 9.5pt;
      }
      .callout--privacy {
        border-left-color: #b91c1c;
        background: #fef2f2;
      }

      .chip {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.5mm 2mm;
        font-size: 8.5pt;
        background: #e6ebf5;
        color: #0b2343;
        border-radius: 1mm;
        margin-right: 1.5mm;
      }

      .turn { margin: 1mm 0; }
      .turn--learner { color: #0b2343; }
      .turn--tutor { color: #047857; }
      .turn .role {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 8.5pt;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        margin-right: 2mm;
      }

      /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         §1 Cover-page-specific styling
         ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .cover {
        page-break-before: auto;
        min-height: 240mm;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .cover__head { margin-top: 30mm; }
      .cover__title {
        font-size: 30pt;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.15;
        color: #0b2343;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .cover__org {
        font-size: 18pt;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 6mm 0 2mm 0;
      }
      .cover__period { font-size: 13pt; color: #334155; }
      .cover__meta { font-size: 9.5pt; color: #5a6b85; margin-bottom: 10mm; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §1 — Cover
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section cover">
      <div class="cover__head">
        <p class="muted">Project Silk — Amber Training Ltd</p>
        <h1 class="cover__title">RARPA Evidence Report</h1>
        <p class="cover__org">{{org.name}}</p>
        <p class="cover__period">
          Reporting period:
          <strong>{{period_start_human}}</strong>
          to
          <strong>{{period_end_human}}</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cover__meta">
        <div>Report ID: <code>{{report_id}}</code></div>
        <div>Generated: {{generated_at_human}}</div>
        <div>Organisation ID: <code>{{org.id}}</code></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §2 — Cohort summary
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">2. Cohort summary</h1>

      <div class="kv">
        <div><div class="k">Learners in cohort</div><div class="v">{{cohort.total_learners}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Total GLH</div><div class="v">{{round1 cohort.total_glh}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">AI-tutor GLH</div><div class="v">{{round1 cohort.ai_glh}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Imported (pre-platform) GLH</div><div class="v">{{round1 cohort.imported_glh}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Teacher-contact GLH</div><div class="v">{{round1 cohort.teacher_contact_glh}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Scenarios passed</div><div class="v">{{cohort.scenarios_passed_total}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Level progressions</div><div class="v">{{cohort.level_progression_count}}</div></div>
      </div>

      <h3>Level distribution</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Level</th><th>Learners</th><th>% of cohort</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each cohort.by_level}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{this.label}}</td>
              <td>{{this.count}}</td>
              <td>{{this.percent}}%</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <p class="muted">Level progressions in period: {{cohort.level_progression_breakdown}}</p>
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §3 — Stage 1 (Initial assessment)
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">3. Stage 1 — Initial assessment</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Learners identified by ULN only. Assessment source is either
        ForSkills import (carried-forward GLH and prior-attainment
        evidence) or platform placement.
      </p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>ULN</th>
            <th>Assessment date</th>
            <th>Source</th>
            <th>Recommended level</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each stage1_rows}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
              <td>{{this.assessment_date_human}}</td>
              <td>{{this.source_label}}</td>
              <td>{{this.recommended_level}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §4 — Stage 2 (Diagnostic / skill-domain analysis)
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">4. Stage 2 — Diagnostic assessment</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Sub-skill weaknesses identified at placement (reading, writing,
        listening, speaking). Drives the Stage 3 individual learning
        plan.
      </p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>ULN</th>
            <th>Source</th>
            <th>Date</th>
            <th>Recommended level</th>
            <th>Weak domains</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each stage2_rows}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
              <td>{{this.source_label}}</td>
              <td>{{this.assessment_date_human}}</td>
              <td>{{this.recommended_level}}</td>
              <td>{{this.weakness_flags_human}} <span class="muted">({{this.weakness_flags_count}})</span></td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §5 — Stage 3 (Individual learning plan)
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">5. Stage 3 — Individual learning plan</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Objectives grouped by target level. Source indicates whether
        the objective was set from placement, a level change, or a
        teacher override.
      </p>

      {{#each stage3_rows}}
        <h3>
          Learner ULN
          {{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}
        </h3>
        {{#each this.grouped_by_level}}
          <p><strong>{{this.level_label}}</strong></p>
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Skill domain</th><th>Objective</th><th>Source</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {{#each this.objectives}}
                <tr>
                  <td>{{this.skill_domain}}</td>
                  <td>{{this.description}}</td>
                  <td><span class="chip">{{this.source_label}}</span></td>
                </tr>
              {{/each}}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        {{/each}}
      {{/each}}
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §6 — Stage 4 (Formative evidence)
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">6. Stage 4 — Formative evidence</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Sessions, scenario completion, vocabulary retention, and
        sampled turn excerpts (early / mid / late). Safeguarding-flagged
        sessions are excluded from excerpt selection at the data layer.
      </p>

      {{#each stage4_rows}}
        <h3>
          Learner ULN
          {{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}
        </h3>
        <div class="kv">
          <div><div class="k">Sessions</div><div class="v">{{this.session_count}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Scenarios passed</div><div class="v">{{this.scenarios_passed}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Vocab retention</div><div class="v">{{this.vocab_retention_pct}}%</div></div>
        </div>

        {{#if (gt this.top_10_retained.length 0)}}
          <p class="muted">Top retained vocabulary:</p>
          <p>
            {{#each this.top_10_retained}}
              <span class="chip">{{this}}</span>
            {{/each}}
          </p>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if (gt this.excerpts.length 0)}}
          <p class="muted">Sample excerpts:</p>
          {{#each this.excerpts}}
            <p>
              <strong>{{this.session_date_human}}</strong>
              <span class="muted">— scenario {{this.scenario_id_human}}</span>
            </p>
            {{#each this.turns}}
              <div class="turn turn--{{this.role}}">
                <span class="role">{{this.role}}</span>{{this.text}}
              </div>
            {{/each}}
          {{/each}}
        {{else}}
          <p class="muted">(No non-flagged sessions in period.)</p>
        {{/if}}
      {{/each}}
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §7 — Stage 5 (RARPA sign-off)
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">7. Stage 5 — RARPA reflective sign-off</h1>

      <div class="kv">
        <div><div class="k">Completed sign-offs</div><div class="v">{{stage5.completed_count}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Pending sign-offs</div><div class="v">{{stage5.pending_count}}</div></div>
      </div>

      <h3>Completed</h3>
      {{#if (gt stage5.completed.length 0)}}
        {{#each stage5.completed}}
          <p>
            <strong>ULN {{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}</strong>
            — {{this.old_level_label}} → {{this.new_level_label}}
            <span class="muted">
              confirmed {{this.confirmed_at_human}} by {{this.confirmed_by_name}}
            </span>
          </p>
          <p class="muted">Learner self-assessment:</p>
          <p>{{this.learner_self_assessment}}</p>
          <p class="muted">AI-tutor summary:</p>
          <p>{{this.ai_tutor_summary}}</p>
          <p class="muted">Next steps:</p>
          <p>{{this.next_steps}}</p>
        {{/each}}
      {{else}}
        <p class="muted">(No completed sign-offs in period.)</p>
      {{/if}}

      <h3>Pending</h3>
      {{#if (gt stage5.pending.length 0)}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>ULN</th><th>Created</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each stage5.pending}}
              <tr>
                <td>{{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
                <td>{{this.created_at_human}}</td>
              </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      {{else}}
        <p class="muted">(No pending sign-offs.)</p>
      {{/if}}
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §8 — Teacher oversight  (FINAL ADDENDUM §4 + §12)
          Explicitly demonstrates that a qualified teacher has reviewed
          the AI-led delivery — the centrepiece of the Phase 2 audit
          response.
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">8. Teacher oversight</h1>
      <div class="callout">
        Every learner is assigned to a qualified ESOL teacher. The
        section below shows cohort-level oversight totals first,
        then a per-learner breakdown.
        <strong>Async review</strong> = teacher review of AI turn
        transcripts;
        <strong>Contact session</strong> = synchronous teaching;
        <strong>Pathway adjustment</strong> = Stage 3 objective edit;
        <strong>RARPA sign-off</strong> = Stage 5 confirmation.
      </div>

      {{!-- ── Final Addendum §12 — cohort aggregates ────────────
            Three numbers Joey called out as the org admin's "did
            teacher oversight actually happen?" glance-test:
              - total cohort teacher GLH
              - average reviews per learner
              - top reviewers (capped at 5) by GLH contributed
                in the reporting window. --}}
      <h3>Cohort totals</h3>
      <div class="kv">
        <div>
          <div class="k">Total teacher GLH</div>
          <div class="v">{{teacher_oversight_aggregates.total_cohort_glh}}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="k">Avg reviews per learner</div>
          <div class="v">{{teacher_oversight_aggregates.average_reviews_per_learner}}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="k">Reviews in period</div>
          <div class="v">{{teacher_oversight_aggregates.review_count}}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="k">Learners in cohort</div>
          <div class="v">{{teacher_oversight_aggregates.learner_count}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {{#if teacher_oversight_aggregates.top_reviewers_by_glh.length}}
        <h3>Top reviewers in period (by GLH contributed)</h3>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Teacher</th>
              <th>GLH contributed</th>
              <th>Reviews logged</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each teacher_oversight_aggregates.top_reviewers_by_glh}}
              <tr>
                <td>{{this.teacher_name}}</td>
                <td>{{this.total_glh}}</td>
                <td>{{this.review_count}}</td>
              </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      {{else}}
        <p class="muted">No teacher reviews recorded in the reporting period.</p>
      {{/if}}

      <h3>Per-learner breakdown</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Learner ULN</th>
            <th>Assigned teacher</th>
            <th>Teacher GLH</th>
            <th>Async</th>
            <th>Contact</th>
            <th>Pathway</th>
            <th>RARPA sign-off</th>
            <th>Last review</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each teacher_oversight_rows}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{#if this.uln}}{{this.uln}}{{else}}<span class="dash">—</span>{{/if}}</td>
              <td>{{this.teacher_name_or_dash}}</td>
              <td>{{this.total_teacher_glh}}</td>
              <td>{{this.counts.async_review}}</td>
              <td>{{this.counts.contact_session}}</td>
              <td>{{this.counts.pathway_adjustment}}</td>
              <td>{{this.counts.rarpa_signoff}}</td>
              <td>{{this.last_review_human}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §9 — ILR data summary
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">9. ILR data summary</h1>
      {{#if ilr.has_linked_export}}
        <div class="kv">
          <div><div class="k">Export ID</div><div class="v"><code>{{ilr.export_id}}</code></div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Generated</div><div class="v">{{ilr.generated_at_human}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Period</div><div class="v">{{ilr.period_start_human}} – {{ilr.period_end_human}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Config version</div><div class="v">{{ilr.compliance_config_version}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Rows exported</div><div class="v">{{ilr.rows_exported}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Rows blocked</div><div class="v">{{ilr.rows_blocked}}</div></div>
          <div><div class="k">Warnings</div><div class="v">{{ilr.warnings_count}}</div></div>
        </div>

        {{#if (gt ilr.warnings_by_type.length 0)}}
          <h3>Warnings by type</h3>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {{#each ilr.warnings_by_type}}
                <tr><td>{{this.type}}</td><td>{{this.count}}</td></tr>
              {{/each}}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        {{/if}}
      {{else}}
        <p class="muted">No completed ILR export linked to this organisation.</p>
      {{/if}}
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §10 — Safeguarding overview  (AGGREGATE-ONLY)
          No learner_id, no messageContentHash, no alert detail crosses
          this boundary. Brief Function 10 + Function 14 To-Do 1.
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">10. Safeguarding overview</h1>

      <div class="callout callout--privacy">
        <strong>Privacy notice:</strong> this section reports
        aggregate counts and resolution metrics only. Individual
        learners, message content, and alert detail are NEVER included
        in this report. Alert detail is accessible only to
        designated-safeguarding-lead users via the live console.
      </div>

      <div class="kv">
        <div><div class="k">Period</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.period_start_human}} – {{safeguarding.period_end_human}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Total alerts</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.total}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Resolved</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.resolved_count}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Resolution rate</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.resolution_rate_pct}}%</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Avg resolution (days)</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.avg_resolution_days}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Median resolution (days)</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.median_resolution_days}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="k">Oldest unresolved (days)</div><div class="v">{{safeguarding.oldest_unresolved_days}}</div></div>
      </div>

      {{#if (gt safeguarding.by_category.length 0)}}
        <h3>By category</h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each safeguarding.by_category}}
              <tr><td>{{this.category_label}}</td><td>{{this.count}}</td></tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      {{/if}}
    </section>

    {{!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          §11 — Methodology appendix
          ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}
    <section class="section">
      <h1 class="section-title">11. Appendix — Methodology</h1>

      <h3>RARPA</h3>
      <p>
        Recognising and Recording Progress and Achievement in
        non-accredited learning. The five-stage RARPA process is the
        Department for Education's framework for evidencing progress in
        community learning. This report follows the five stages in
        order: initial assessment (Stage 1), diagnostic assessment
        (Stage 2), individual learning plan (Stage 3), formative
        assessment (Stage 4), and reflective summative review (Stage 5).
      </p>

      <h3>Teacher oversight</h3>
      <p>
        AI-led delivery is supplemented by a qualified ESOL teacher
        for every learner. Section 8 summarises teacher activity
        across four review types. Teacher GLH is counted separately
        from AI-tutor GLH in the cohort totals.
      </p>

      <h3>Vocabulary retention</h3>
      <p>
        Vocabulary retention is computed from the per-learner
        VocabLedger: a word is retained when the learner has
        demonstrated correct use across at least three independent
        sessions. Top retained words are ranked by encounter count and
        most-recent use.
      </p>

      <h3>Sampling — Stage 4 excerpts</h3>
      <p>
        For each learner, up to three session excerpts are sampled
        across the reporting period — one early, one mid, one late.
        Safeguarding-flagged sessions are excluded from the sample at
        the data layer (not the rendering layer).
      </p>

      <h3>ILR data</h3>
      <p>
        Field mappings and validation rules are read from the
        versioned ComplianceConfig collection (domain <code>ilr</code>).
        Demo organisations cannot generate ILR exports. The linked
        export referenced in section 9 carries its own config-version
        stamp.
      </p>

      <h3>Privacy</h3>
      <p>
        Learners are identified by ULN only across this document.
        Safeguarding alerts are reported in aggregate only — no
        learner identifier, message content, or alert detail crosses
        the report boundary. The report is watermarked and the disk
        copy is access-controlled.
      </p>

      <p class="muted">
        Report ID <code>{{report_id}}</code> · Generated
        {{generated_at_human}} · {{org.name}}
      </p>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
